 risen <strong class='sig'>+0.21\u00b0F per decade</strong> (95% range +0.15 to +0.27), about +2.8\u00b0F since 1893. Martinsburg's average high has risen <strong class='sig'>+0.07\u00b0F per decade</strong> (95% range +0.00 to +0.14), about +0.9\u00b0F since 1893.","t_mon":"Lows rose in 9 of 12 months. Highs rose in 5 of 12 months; May fell.","t_rain":"Rain and snow: no clear long-term change","p_rain":"Martinsburg's yearly precipitation shows no clear long-term change (+0.09 inches per decade, a range that includes zero). The 1991\u20132020 normal is 39.7 inches a year. The wettest year was 2018 (61.58 in); the driest, 1930 (21.43 in).","show_snow":true,"sig_bars":{"lo":false,"hi":false},"t_year":"2026 so far: 9 daily record highs, 1 daily record low"}}